{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking"},"metadata":{"title":"LifecycleTracking","role":"collection","externalID":"LifecycleTracking","modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"],"title":"Tracking the lifecycle","anchor":"Tracking-the-lifecycle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"],"title":"Events","anchor":"Events"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore"],"title":"Keeping the version","anchor":"Keeping-the-version"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"],"title":"Delivering as the app leaves","anchor":"Delivering-as-the-app-leaves"},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Afluent"],"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this module to track the application’s lifecycle on any platform. Nothing is tracked until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackLifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":" on its tracker as it launches, and keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it returns; tracking stops when that is cancelled, finished or released."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For the screens and controls inside the app, see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As it starts, it compares the app’s version (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleShortVersionString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by default, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"version:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") with the one its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore"},{"text":" saved at the last launch. No saved version tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled"},{"text":", a different one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated"},{"text":", the same one neither. Then it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened"},{"text":". After that, from ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s, ","type":"text"},{"code":"WKApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s notifications, it tracks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened"},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the background and, where the platform reports it, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"},{"text":", each once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition. A server or a tool on Linux has no notifications, so it calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()"},{"text":" as it ends:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle(version: \"2.1\", versionStore: InMemoryVersionStore(version: \"2.0\"))","\/\/ tracks ApplicationUpdated(previousVersion: \"2.0\", version: \"2.1\"), then ApplicationOpened(fromBackground: false)","","\/\/ ... the process's work ...","","await lifecycle.finish()  \/\/ tracks ApplicationTerminated","await tracker.finish()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The store keeps the version and nothing else. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in a file, by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beside a "},{"code":"SegmentStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s records; "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in memory, for tests; any type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of yours can conform. "},{"code":"kinds:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" turns kinds of event off, while the version is still saved."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the app leaves the foreground, it waits for the tracker’s worker to write every record tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so far to the tracker’s store, then calls the store’s "},{"code":"synchronize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":".lifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") sends what is pending as it reads the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"type":"text","text":" record. The notification’s handler only hands the transition on; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work runs on a task of its own, and where the system suspends apps in the background it holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background time until the records are durable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/lifecycletracking"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the"},{"type":"text","text